Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.43,0:01:20.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:20.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.70,0:01:23.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:23.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.13,0:01:25.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.13,0:01:25.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There, there, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.28,0:01:26.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出什么大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:26.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the big "D"?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  蟹黄堡全没了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, we're all out of Krabby Patties, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.63,0:01:33.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么好大惊小怪的  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:33.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's nothing to fuss over, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.08,0:01:36.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,像从前一样再做一批就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:36.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll just whip up a new batch, like we did in the old days
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.41,0:01:40.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我对这流程了如蟹爪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:40.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know this process like the back of me claw
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.05,0:01:41.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开始都是先加
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:41.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We always start with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:42.45,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(146,244)}面粉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.72,0:01:42.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,面粉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:42.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Flour
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.18,0:01:46.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后加藤壶屑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:46.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next, we add barnacle shavings
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.52,0:01:50.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就跟骑自行船一样简单吧  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:50.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's like riding a boat cycle, ain't it, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简单到忘不了  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You never forget, boss man
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.72,0:01:55.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来这步一起来加  怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:55.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do ya say we do the next one together, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.39,标准-Chi,,0,600,0,,海盐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.39,标准-Eng,,0,600,0,,Sea salt
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.39,标准-Chi,,600,0,0,,姜黄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.39,标准-Eng,,600,0,0,,Turmeric
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说什么玩意  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you on about, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.33,0:01:59.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第三步向来是加海盐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.33,0:01:59.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The third step is always sea salt
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.47,0:02:00.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:00.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's funny
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我记得第三步是姜黄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I remember turmeric third
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.57,0:02:03.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且秘方要的不是陆盐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.57,0:02:03.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And doesn't the recipe call for land salt?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.51,0:02:05.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是海盐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:05.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's sea salt
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.51,0:02:07.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就不记得结痂法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:07.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't ya remember scabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.22,0:02:09.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么结痂法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:09.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Scabs," sir?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.06,0:02:11.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个结痂法啊  全称是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:11.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, S.C.A.B.S., you know
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.17,0:02:11.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放盐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:11.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Salt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:11.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs60\pos(720,920)}S
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.91,0:02:12.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就得
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:12.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,comes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:12.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs60\pos(720,920)}C
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.61,0:02:13.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先加
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.61,0:02:13.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,after
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.61,0:02:13.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs60\pos(720,920)}A
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.27,0:02:14.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,藤壶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:14.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,barnacle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:14.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs60\pos(720,920)}B
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.07,0:02:15.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,屑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:15.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,shavings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:15.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs60\pos(720,920)}S
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是病变法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or was it L.E.S.I.O.N.S.?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.18,0:02:20.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听着也不太对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:20.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, that doesn't sound right either
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.82,0:02:21.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是脓疱法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:21.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Was it was "pustule"?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.81,0:02:22.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.81,0:02:22.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heavens, no
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.21,0:02:24.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:24.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, tell ya what
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.72,0:02:27.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还是去拿秘方好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:27.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't I just go fetch the formula?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:29.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直接一劳永逸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:29.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll settle this once and for all
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.77,0:02:35.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用琢磨了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:35.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to wonder about this
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.97,0:02:37.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你秘方到我手上了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:37.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got your formula
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.70,0:02:43.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就不嫌烦吗  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:43.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aren't you getting a little tired of this, Plankton?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.22,0:02:48.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不尊重一下传统吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:48.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any respect for tradition?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.89,0:02:51.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然尊重了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:51.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course I do
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.64,0:02:53.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我才要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.64,0:02:53.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm doing this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:56.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(408,708)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.14,0:03:01.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得想办法让痞老板别来偷我宝贝秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:58.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to somehow get Plankton
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:01.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to stop coming after me precious formula
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.37,0:03:03.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:03.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我为了让小蜗远离饼干盒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To keep Gary out of the biscuit tin
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.20,0:03:07.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就把饼干藏到了很远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:07.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hide the biscuits somewhere far away
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,像是派大星家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like Patrick's house
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.60,0:03:11.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜到头来饼干被派大星吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Patrick ends up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,eating the biscuits anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, that's it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.23,0:03:14.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:14.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you genius
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你解决了我几十年来的难题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You just solved me decades-old dilemma
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我警告你  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.97,0:03:20.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你给派大星什么  他就会吃什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:20.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick will eat anything you give him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:21.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(428,610)}裤头村特别报道
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,突发新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Breaking news
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天早些时候  尤金蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Earlier today, Mr. Eugene Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.81,0:03:26.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王餐厅的所有者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:26.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,proprietor of the Krusty Krab restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,与他心爱的秘方分别了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,parted with his beloved secret formula
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.55,0:03:31.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在连线现场记者帕奇帕金斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.55,0:03:31.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We now go to Perch Perkins, live on the scene
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:37.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(306,380)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:37.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1086,266)}直播
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.60,0:03:32.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢伊莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:32.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Elaine
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.51,0:03:33.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在不久前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.51,0:03:33.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just moments ago
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.52,0:03:37.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尤金蟹送走了知名的美味蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:35.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eugene Krabs sent his famously delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:37.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,secret Krabby Patty formula packing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.72,0:03:39.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保重  小小秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.72,0:03:39.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take care of yerself, little formuler
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.37,0:03:48.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(592,350)}裤头村搬家
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.05,0:04:00.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:00.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good-bye, secret recipe
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.05,0:04:04.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们想问尤金蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:04.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We wanted to ask Mr. Eugene Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.39,0:04:07.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是什么迫使他采取如此极端的措施
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:07.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what compelled him to take such drastic measures
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.15,0:04:08.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很简单  帕奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:08.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's simple, Perch
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.57,0:04:11.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,事实证明把秘方攥在自己手里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:10.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It seems keeping me secret formula at hand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:11.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,has proven to be
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.44,0:04:13.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,容易引来某个小小的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:13.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all too tempting for a certain diminutive
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又是个独眼的社会犯罪分子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,one-eyed criminal element of society
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.15,0:04:19.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我总算让他知难而退了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:19.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I finally got him in full retreat
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.32,0:04:29.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  继续来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:29.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, boy, let's get back to making them patties
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.66,0:04:31.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚应该是加到姜黄了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:31.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe we were at turmeric
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  我不是跟你说过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, I thought I told ya--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.02,0:04:34.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:34.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.75,0:04:35.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们忘了看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:35.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We forgot to look at the--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.75,0:04:37.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方  对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:37.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Formuler, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.70,0:04:39.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而秘方已经
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:39.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that formula is
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.75,0:04:43.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跑到海洋另一头了  对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:43.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,On the opposite side of the ocean, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.30,0:04:52.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在只好大老远过去取了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:52.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now I've got to go all the way there to get it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.27,0:04:54.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:54.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.25,0:04:54.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:54.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.81,0:04:56.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派我去取回秘方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:56.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Send me to retrieve that formula
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.98,0:04:58.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉得自己能应付这挑战吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:58.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Think you're up for the challenge?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.90,0:05:00.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:00.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, all right, then
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.99,0:05:05.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方正存放在一个保险箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:05.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The formuler is now stowed in a safe deposit box
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保险箱在全海洋最大最安全的银行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in the ocean's largest, safest bank
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.87,0:05:10.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,地址在远在天边镇村
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:10.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in wayfarout townville
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.78,0:05:13.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是保险箱钥匙吗  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:13.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that's the key to the box, eh, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.75,0:05:14.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:14.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.62,0:05:17.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  这是我心脏的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:17.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, this is the key to me heart
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这才是保险箱钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the safe deposit box key
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.75,0:05:24.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:24.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, mister--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.17,0:05:25.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别急  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:25.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.07,0:05:28.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要你不惜代价保护它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:28.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want you to protect this at all costs
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.60,0:05:30.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准让它远离你视线
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:30.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mustn't let it out of your sight
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.22,0:05:35.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我特此授予你通向蟹堡王未来的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I now bestow unto you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:35.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the key to the future of the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我谦恭领受这把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I humbly accept this key
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.27,0:05:39.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,发誓用自己的生命保卫它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:39.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and vow to guard it with my very life
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝不使其远离我视线
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It shan't leaveth mine sight
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.67,0:05:43.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  带你去火车站
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:43.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good, let's get you over to the train station
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.67,0:05:45.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不费吹灰之力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:45.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is too easy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.09,0:05:48.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦  我要出差了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.09,0:05:48.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen, I'm off on a business trip
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不必熬夜等我回来  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't wait up for me, baby
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.08,0:05:55.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海底快车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:55.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The oceanic express
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝我好运
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wish me luck
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.37,0:05:59.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了我跟你说的话  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.37,0:05:59.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.83,0:06:01.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看好钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:01.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep your eye on the key
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.38,0:06:03.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来帮你提行李  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:03.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can take your luggage, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.57,0:06:05.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:05.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please follow me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.28,0:06:07.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现实中的管家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:07.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A real-life butler
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.67,0:06:09.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不是管家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.67,0:06:09.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am not a butler
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.85,0:06:11.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上车了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:11.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All aboard
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.22,0:06:14.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你好运  我的小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:14.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good luck, me boy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.77,0:06:15.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别让我失望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:15.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.06,0:06:21.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:21.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait for me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.02,0:06:25.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:25.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacles
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早知道就叫辆出租了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have sprung for a taxi
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.47,0:06:30.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去你的公共交通
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:30.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Curse you, public transport
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我非得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, I ought to--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.97,0:06:37.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这回倒准时起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:37.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now they're on time
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的卧铺包厢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your sleeping quarters
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.69,0:06:46.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望一切合你们的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:46.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I trust everything is to your liking
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.77,0:06:48.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再好不过了  管家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:48.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Couldn't be better, butler
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许先生没听清
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perhaps monsieur did not hear me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.05,0:06:53.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望一切合你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:53.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I trust everything is to your
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.94,0:06:54.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,心意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:54.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Liking?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.97,0:06:58.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.97,0:06:58.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.02,0:06:58.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:58.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How silly of me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.63,0:07:01.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一点无心之过  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:01.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,An honest mistake, monsieur
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.40,0:07:02.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢  好先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:02.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my good man
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.21,0:07:05.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找个垃圾桶已经找了起码有十分钟了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:04.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been hunting for a trash can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,522)}卷饼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:05.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for at least ten minutes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.77,0:07:07.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再次感谢  法国佬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:07.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks again, French guy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.77,0:07:09.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变鬼脸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:09.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Peekaboo
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick, remember
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是在执行重要任务
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we're on an important mission here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.77,0:07:16.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以得密切注意任何可疑人物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:16.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so keep your eyes open for any suspicious characters
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.47,0:07:22.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你觉得他样子可疑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:22.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, does that guy look suspicious to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.65,0:07:24.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他有可能在监视我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:24.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think he might be spying on us
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,疑神疑鬼的都饿死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All this suspicion is making me hungry
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.00,0:07:31.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就跟我来餐车
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:31.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, then follow me to the dining car
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.54,0:07:39.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来这一路总算要顺风顺水起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:39.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's starting to roll my way for a change
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.63,0:07:41.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么都别想挡我的路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:41.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and nothing dare stand in my way
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.17,0:07:52.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道能赶得上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:52.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew I'd make it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.76,0:07:57.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好高档
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:57.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fancy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.73,0:07:58.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:58.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.53,0:08:01.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给的食物都多到得用两把叉子来吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:08:01.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And they give you so much food, you need two forks
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.37,0:08:07.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一个可爱的小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:07.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a cute little baby
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.39,0:08:09.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用哭哭啼啼了  小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.39,0:08:09.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to fuss, little fella
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.88,0:08:12.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没法让他不再哭下去  可怜的宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:12.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just can't get him to stop crying, the poor dear
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又见面了  好心的管家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi again, kind butler
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.95,0:08:20.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:20.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So sorry, monsieur
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.37,0:08:22.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,餐车打烊了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:22.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The dining car is closed now
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.82,0:08:24.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我们连特餐是什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:24.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we haven't even heard the special yet
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.72,0:08:27.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,餐车就是为了不招待你才打烊的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:27.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, the dining car is over for you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.64,0:08:29.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你现在必须走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:29.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You must leave now
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.65,0:08:33.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:33.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.28,0:08:35.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事的  帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:35.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's quite all right, handsome
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.68,0:08:37.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好友善的小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:37.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Friendly lady
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.67,0:08:39.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  得找个安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:39.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, Patrick, we better find a safe place
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来存放它过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to store this for the night
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.47,0:08:42.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:42.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.45,0:08:44.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我亲爱的派大星  就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:44.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That, my dear Patrick, is--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the key
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.32,0:08:46.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  钥匙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:46.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, where's the key?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.51,0:08:47.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:47.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.09,0:08:48.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我庄严宣誓了的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:48.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I took a solemn oath
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  是你偷了保险箱钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton, you stole the safety deposit key
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.15,0:08:54.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:54.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.82,0:08:55.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才刚上车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:55.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just got here
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才没有偷到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have stolen it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.35,0:08:58.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,暂时没
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:08:58.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yet
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯  我不相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, no offense, but I don't believe you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.43,0:09:04.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说我骗你们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:04.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You calling me a liar?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搜他身  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Search him, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.57,0:09:08.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乐意之至
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:08.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With pleasure
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.87,0:09:11.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好全身都搜一遍  矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:11.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prepare for a thorough search, shorty
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.94,0:09:12.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:12.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, dread
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.31,0:09:14.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先等我把这碗擦干净
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:14.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After I scrub this bowl
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.81,0:09:17.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:17.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.29,0:09:19.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该逼你交出钥匙了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:19.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,time to squeeze the key out of you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.70,0:09:25.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先等我吃完好吃的零食
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:25.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After my tasty snack
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.20,0:09:30.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他是清白的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:30.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's clean
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.45,0:09:33.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就说我没骗你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:33.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you I wasn't lying
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.71,0:09:36.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果你没偷  会是谁偷的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:36.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, if you didn't steal it, then who did?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定是这列车上的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must have been someone on this train
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.87,0:09:39.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  报警
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:39.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, call the cops
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.47,0:09:42.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,警察  我报你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:42.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cops, I need you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.27,0:09:47.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.27,0:09:47.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.19,0:09:49.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:49.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.17,0:09:51.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:51.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.10,0:09:53.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:53.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.28,0:09:55.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快给我一个蟹黄堡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:55.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just give me a patty, man
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.37,0:09:58.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再说最后一次  没有蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:58.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For the last time, we're out of patties
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.58,0:10:02.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别那么激动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:02.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to get excited, now
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.42,0:10:04.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要吃到蟹黄堡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:04.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want our patties, man
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.30,0:10:07.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是蟹堡王的财物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:07.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's Krusty Krab property
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是承重柱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a load-bearing column
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hurry, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.40,0:10:15.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:15.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As you know
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天这里发生了一起难以言表的罪行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an unspeakable crime has been committed here today
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.09,0:10:20.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们每一个都有作案条件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:20.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and each of you had the means to do it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.00,0:10:23.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问题是  谁作的案
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:23.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The question is, who?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.98,0:10:24.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:24.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You there
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.97,0:10:27.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别想装无辜骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:27.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not fooling me with that innocent act
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.55,0:10:29.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,1月16号晚上6点42分你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:29.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where were you at 6:42 P.M. on the night of January 16th?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准给我回答咕咕嘎嘎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't you give me that "goo-goo, ga-ga" stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.72,0:10:33.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:33.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.02,0:10:34.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,警察局长先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:34.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Police commissioner?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  海绵宝宝先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. SquarePants?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.12,0:10:36.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我认
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:36.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I sub--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.82,0:10:41.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我认为这起大劫案的罪魁祸首
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:39.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I submit to you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:41.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that the perpetrator of this heinous theft
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.37,0:10:42.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是别人  正是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:42.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is none other than
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.00,0:10:44.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:44.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The nanny
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.17,0:10:48.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没偷东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:48.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I haven't stolen a thing
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.37,0:10:52.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,长官  搜查这个宝宝的尿布
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:52.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you search this baby's diaper
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就能找到失窃的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you'll find the stolen key
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.60,0:10:55.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好的  海绵宝宝先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:55.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.82,0:11:00.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:00.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The key
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.34,0:11:02.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:02.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,At last, I found it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.71,0:11:05.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  海绵宝宝先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:05.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.50,0:11:08.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你发现了海神王的海之珠宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:08.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You uncovered Neptune's jewel of the sea
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.48,0:11:11.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逮到了臭名昭著的窃宝三胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:11.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and nabbed the infamous jewel triplets gang
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.81,0:11:12.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪来的三
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:12.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Triplets?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.52,0:11:14.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就说不该坐火车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:14.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you taking the train was a mistake
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.28,0:11:19.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没办那优惠卡  我们也不至于在逃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:16.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we wouldn't be on the lam
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:19.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if you hadn't applied for that discount card
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.43,0:11:21.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忍不住想节约不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.43,0:11:21.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I help it if I'm frugal?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.40,0:11:23.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去跟狱友说吧  小不点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:23.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell it to your cellmate, junior
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.87,0:11:27.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果他们没偷  那么偷钥匙的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.87,0:11:27.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If they didn't do it, that means the key was stolen by
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.55,0:11:28.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,管家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:28.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The butler
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.15,0:11:31.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝对没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:31.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I certainly did not
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.45,0:11:33.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们知道是你偷的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:33.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We know you did it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.22,0:11:35.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,犯罪的向来是管家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:35.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The butler always commits the crime
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再说最后一遍  我不是管家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For the last time, I am not a butler
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我连管家的口音都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't even have the butler accent
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然你可能不是管家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You may not be a butler
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你是不是狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but are you a werewolf?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.87,0:12:06.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,管家  你也许骗得了海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:06.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, butler, you may have hoodwinked the sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.24,0:12:08.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我不是好欺负的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:08.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I ain't no pushover
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.17,0:12:10.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:10.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之  你既然没偷钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anyway, since you didn't steal the key
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.72,0:12:17.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那想必愿意让人搜查你的舱位吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:17.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,then you'd obviously submit to a search of your cabin
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没舱位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do not have a cabin
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.95,0:12:20.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我睡行李上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.95,0:12:20.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I sleep on the luggage
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.21,0:12:22.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就是这么偷钥匙的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:22.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's how you stole it
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.38,0:12:23.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:23.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give it to me
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.22,0:12:23.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:23.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me the key
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  需不需要我提醒一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Need I remind you, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.18,0:12:28.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你自己也是个嫌疑犯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:28.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that you are still a suspect yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.74,0:12:32.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说  把钥匙还给海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:32.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean give SpongeBob back the key
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.05,0:12:34.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不相信你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:34.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't believe either of you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搜身
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shake 'em down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(684,920)}摇
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.45,标准-Chi,,0,700,0,,没什么可疑的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.45,标准-Eng,,0,700,0,,Nothing suspicious here
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.92,0:12:51.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只不过你正好揭发了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:51.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,except for the fact that you have just outed
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.80,0:12:55.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,国际逃犯奥林杰拉菲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:55.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Orin J. Roughy, international fugitive
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.25,0:12:58.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,通缉原因是贪污了价值七万五千多的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,wanted for the embezzlement
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of over 75,000 bucks' worth of
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.45,0:13:00.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,火腿三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:00.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ham sandwiches
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忙活半天还是没找到钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After all this, I still haven't found the key
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.48,0:13:09.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我违背了对蟹老板的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:09.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I broke my vow to Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.47,0:13:13.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不配在蟹堡王上班
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:13.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve to work at the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.14,0:13:14.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:14.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钥匙一定会出现的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll turn up
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.65,0:13:18.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:18.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The key
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.81,0:13:23.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你到底上哪找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:23.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, where in the ocean's depths did you find it?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是在洗你短裤的时候找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I found it when I was cleaning your shorts
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.67,0:13:29.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟你早些时候出了点  小意外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:29.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from your little "accident" earlier
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that is great news
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.36,0:13:33.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:33.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anyways
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.65,0:13:35.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要睡觉去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.65,0:13:35.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hit the sack
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.65,0:13:36.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都累坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.65,0:13:36.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm pooped
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.65,0:13:36.46,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(754,920)}拉 屎
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.69,0:13:38.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你肯定能理解吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:38.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can relate
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.84,0:13:40.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我也累
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:40.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.62,0:13:44.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也很累
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:44.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me three
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.95,0:13:52.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:52.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,介意挪过去一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you mind scooching over?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我连眉毛都动不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't even move my eyebrows
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.70,0:13:59.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:13:59.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.05,0:14:01.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的  这又不是豪华套房
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:01.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, this isn't exactly a luxury suite
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.97,0:14:03.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来  我应该帮得上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.97,0:14:03.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, maybe I can help
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新鲜海水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fresh water
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.05,0:14:12.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好酷的视野
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:12.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a cool view
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  来个更好的视野
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, have a better look
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们送钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And thanks for the key
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来被他甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess he lost us
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.32,0:14:32.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好收工了吗  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:32.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You ready to call it a day, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来没好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess not
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.85,0:14:39.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  数到三
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:39.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Patrick, on the count of three
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.67,0:14:41.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就跳上去  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.67,0:14:41.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll jump on, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明白  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got ya, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.79,0:14:44.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  我不会数那么多数
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:44.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, I can't count that high
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.52,0:14:46.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能数到一就跳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:46.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can we just jump on the count of one?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.09,0:14:47.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样也行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:47.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll work too
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  数到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, on the count of--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what the--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.22,0:14:54.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可还行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:54.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.65,0:14:55.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:55.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.62,0:15:00.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  跳到我背上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:00.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, hop up on my back
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.17,0:15:03.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在玩骑马不太适合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:01.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think this is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the right time for a piggyback ride
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.63,0:15:04.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:04.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just do it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.76,0:15:05.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:05.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我看不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I don't see
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.34,0:15:08.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样怎么就能让我们接近那个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:08.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how this is going to get us any closer to that--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.05,0:15:11.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:11.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  不管惹你什么麻烦都对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm sorry for any grief I've caused you
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,千万不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, please
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.14,0:15:26.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:26.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're flying
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.31,0:15:28.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.31,0:15:28.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here ya go, buddy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:30.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(468,336)}有丝分裂与你
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.82,0:15:37.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:37.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Plankton?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.14,0:15:39.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可躲不了一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:39.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't hide forever
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.16,0:15:43.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你们顶了不少压力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:43.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got a lot on your mind
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.44,0:16:03.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  你已经到终点站了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:03.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, Plankton, end of the line
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.20,0:16:08.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这呢  俩火车头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:08.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Over here, choo-choo heads
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.53,0:16:18.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:18.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that was odd
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  钥匙还在痞老板手上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and Plankton still has the key
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.55,0:16:28.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  有个大麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:28.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, we've got a big problem
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.35,0:16:35.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都哪去了  那些
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.35,0:16:35.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are all those
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.22,0:16:36.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亮晶晶的管子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:36.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shiny tubes?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是这个  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's just it, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They aren't there
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In that case
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.10,0:16:49.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:49.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.87,0:16:51.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还有地方得去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:51.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got places to be
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go, already
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:56.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(404,668)}欢迎来到\N远在天边村
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:57.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,726)}银行
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.55,0:16:59.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:16:59.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's too easy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.21,0:17:13.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  得让这玩意停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:13.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, we have to stop this thing
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.03,0:17:14.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去看看能不能拿那东西干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:14.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go see if you can do something with that stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.75,0:17:15.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去开门
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:15.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll try to get the door open
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.94,0:17:17.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:17.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.69,0:17:18.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:18.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:23.68,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1006,850)}刹车
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.45,0:17:22.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,BRAKE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:22.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,B-r-a-k-e
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.17,0:17:23.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,弄坏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:23.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Break
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:24.98,注释,,0,0,0,,[ brake（刹车）与 break（弄坏）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.02,0:17:24.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:24.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can do that
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.49,0:17:29.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  麻烦解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:29.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, SpongeBob, I think our troubles are over
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.90,0:17:32.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你弄坏了刹车吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:32.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You broke the brake?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.10,0:17:34.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它叫我弄坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:34.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It told me to
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.45,0:17:35.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:35.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What will we do now?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里总有个啥玩意能让火车停下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One of these thing-a-ma-whosies has to stop the train
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.24,0:17:39.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.24,0:17:39.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, try something
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm on it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.90,0:17:43.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许把这些黑色石块铲进去能有用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:43.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe shoveling in these black rocks will help
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.77,0:17:57.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:57.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help us
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.31,0:17:57.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托救命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.31,0:17:57.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please help us
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.78,0:18:01.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们上的这列火车失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:18:01.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're on an out-of-control train
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.10,0:18:04.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总控呼叫五号机车
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:04.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is central control to engine five
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.90,0:18:05.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,收得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:05.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you copy?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.70,0:18:07.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  我这就重复
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:07.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, yes sir, I copy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:07.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(886,920)}收 到
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.18,0:18:09.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是海绵宝宝  上的这列火车失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.18,0:18:09.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm SpongeBob, and I'm on an out-of-control train
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.80,0:18:11.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小朋友  让火车司机接
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:11.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Kid, let me talk to the engineer
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.58,0:18:13.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:13.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.05,0:18:14.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就开火车的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:14.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The guy driving the train
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.85,0:18:16.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我在开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.85,0:18:16.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That would be me
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.90,0:18:17.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星也在这
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:17.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And Patrick's here too
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟好先生打招呼  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say hi to the nice gentleman, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.09,0:18:19.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:19.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,火车后面那堆全没了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The back of the train is gone
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.66,0:18:22.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:22.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.95,0:18:25.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,火车直冲养老院开去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:25.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That train's headed straight for the rest home
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:27.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(922,648)}养老院
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.79,0:18:28.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就表示
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:28.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that means--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.80,0:18:29.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,表示啥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:29.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Means what?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.53,0:18:29.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,表示啥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:29.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Means what?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.95,0:18:30.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那表示啥  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.95,0:18:30.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What does that mean, mister?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.11,0:18:33.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,表示那列火车就要穿过那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:33.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It means that train is coming right through that--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:35.63,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(282,170)}火车检修站
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.22,0:18:39.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心歪七扭八铁路栈架
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:39.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Beware the twisted trestles, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.60,0:18:40.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:40.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.95,0:18:42.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:42.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's that
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.33,0:18:59.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.33,0:18:59.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was fun
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.43,0:19:02.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  要干嘛来着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:02.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now, where were we?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.51,0:19:03.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:03.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.50,0:19:04.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会救我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:04.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll save us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:11.58,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,292)}停
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:26.51,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(910,182)}免费柠檬水
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.17,0:19:21.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冰镇柠檬水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:21.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ice-cold lemonade
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.21,0:19:25.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来买冰镇美味清爽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:25.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get your ice-cold, tasty, refreshing
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.05,0:19:26.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又冰镇的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:26.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and also ice-cold--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.65,0:19:30.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,路过的都会停下来喝免费柠檬水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:30.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone stops for free lemonade
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好样的  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attaboy, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别放
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't give--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.40,0:19:41.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是大英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:41.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a hero
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait for me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.70,0:19:53.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:53.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.80,0:20:08.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你背后有辆火车
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:08.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a train behind you
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得这招能骗我几次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How many times you think I'm falling for that one?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.31,0:20:12.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能不要闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:12.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you quit messing around?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.85,0:20:14.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都快晕车了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:14.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're making me sick
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  老人家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, oldsters
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们虽然想留下来帮忙收拾干净
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'd love to stay and help you clean up the mess
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.33,0:20:38.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但还得去救秘方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:38.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but we've got a formula to save
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:50.47,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,618)}节流杆
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.85,0:20:49.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,节流杆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.85,0:20:49.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,T-h-r-o-t-t-l-e
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.85,0:20:49.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(720,920)}掐 死
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.93,0:20:50.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是弄坏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:50.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Break
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.47,0:20:52.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:52.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can do that
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.29,0:20:57.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你应该用不上这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:57.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You didn't need this, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:20:58.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,618)}节流杆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.36,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(714,452)}银行
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.39,0:21:10.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快到爸爸这来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.39,0:21:10.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come to papa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.57,0:21:16.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的大胜之日总算来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:16.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,At last, my day of triumph has come
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.69,0:21:17.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再次到来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:17.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Again
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.65,0:21:19.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:19.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, well
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.49,0:21:23.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.49,0:21:23.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.07,0:21:23.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:23.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but how?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.05,0:21:25.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不会真以为
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:25.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You honestly didn't think
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.30,0:21:28.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,情况这么复杂  我会忘了考虑到你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:26.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would've left you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:28.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out of this elaborate equation, did ya?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.58,0:21:30.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以解释  尤金
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:30.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can explain, Eugene
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.47,0:21:34.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是在帮你给它保温而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:34.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was just keeping it warm for ya, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.70,0:21:36.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:36.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe ya
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.82,0:21:41.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然你费了这么大劲才来到这
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:39.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, since you went through
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:41.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all the trouble of getting here
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.29,0:21:42.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你进去吧  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:42.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.00,0:21:44.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欣赏沿途风景吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:44.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the scenery
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.12,0:21:45.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:45.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.16,0:21:47.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝杀  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:47.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Checkmate, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good job, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.15,0:22:04.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是打不败的  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:04.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I simply refuse to fail, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.10,0:22:06.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:06.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's all very wonderful
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.22,0:22:07.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但介意跟我说说看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:07.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but would you mind telling me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.56,0:22:09.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要怎么赔偿银行的损失吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.56,0:22:09.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how you intend to pay for the damage to the bank?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.80,0:22:12.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:12.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, I just remembered
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.97,0:22:14.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己有场重要会议要赶不上了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.97,0:22:14.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm late for a very important meeting
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.85,0:22:16.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你来搞定行不行  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.85,0:22:16.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take care of it, will ya, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.35,0:22:17.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别急  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.35,0:22:17.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.86,0:22:21.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你银行户头里的钱刚好够赔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:19.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got just enough
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:21.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in your bank account to cover the cost
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.96,0:22:31.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:31.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.28,0:22:33.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,七十五年后
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.86,0:22:39.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就是海底快车大劫案的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.86,0:22:39.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that was the story of the great train caper
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.11,0:22:40.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是很刺激啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.11,0:22:40.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Didn't ya find it exciting?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.67,0:22:44.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,破自己高分记录了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:44.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just beat my high score
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.52,0:22:45.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:45.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.08,0:22:48.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在的小孩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:48.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Kids today
